desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Living-world tick: ephemeral hand-off from the metronome to the world-director
Game/.world-tick-queue.md

# Living-world drift audit: ephemeral GM-only report, rebuildable any time with
# `python Tools/world_health.py`. Never commit it — it can carry spoilers.
Game/.world-health.md

# Local semantic-memory index: a rebuildable artifact (markdown is the source of
# truth). Regenerate any time with `python Tools/memory_index.py`.
Game/.memory-index/

# Living-world dashboard: the GM/author god-view, rebuildable any time with
# `python Tools/world_dashboard.py`. Never commit it — it carries spoilers
# (unaware plots, NPC drives, contested-control numbers).
Game/world-dashboard.md
